    description: "Phase 3 of ADR-0027, Cluster H. Domain-specific long-tail values (~70+: section, paragraph, code_block, diagram, plot, yield, for_loop, conditional, declaration, prefix, base, query, entry, task, python_task, addtask, entity, architecture, error_set, participant, state, model, fragment, partial, provider, local, style_block, permission, keyframes, media, font_face, class_selector, id_selector, etc.).\n\nThe cluster-H audit-findings doc is expected to be the longest of the series. Many values are domain-vocabulary nouns that read fine as language_construct (code_block, paragraph, diagram for documentation languages); a non-trivial subset are leakage of the Cluster-D / -E shape (handler, signal, model, entity).\n\nPer-value audit. File audit-findings doc at docs/audits/<NN>-symbol-kind-cluster-h-long-tail.md per the docs/audits/README.md format spec. Per-value verdicts (CANONICAL / FOLD / DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD per ADR-0024 §\"Family-audit verdict methodology\") in the audit-findings.\n\nReference: docs/adr/0027-symbol-kind-language-construct-only.md §\"Phase 3\" Cluster H and §\"Risks\" long-tail."  # de7e
    fields: {}  # de7e
